  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop tomato, cucumber and coriander.\n• In a small bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, coriander and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Roughly chop brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc53ffc37702f5b7ae993/step-48055a00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice mini flour tortillas into wedges and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle or spray generously with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc53ffc37702f5b7ae993/step-71e3f810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 4-5 mins. Add kidney beans and cook, lightly crushing with the back of a spoon, until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir through tomato paste and Mexican Fiesta spice blend (add less if you’re sensitive to heat!) and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add the water and BBQ sauce. Cook, stirring occasionally, until thickened, 1-2 mins. Stir in the butter and season to taste. Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese and cover with a lid until melted, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc53ffc37702f5b7ae993/step-0da78c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tortilla chips between plates.\n• Top with bean mixture and cucumber tomato salsa. Drizzle over the mayonnaise to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc53ffc37702f5b7ae993/step-c5621030.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
